{"pages":[{"ocr":false,"segs":[["PRAYER, CARE, AND SHARE",120.75999999999999,33.840599999999995,415.65999999999997,176.00059999999996,80,false],["This is a relational evangelism strategy that can be",146.40000000000001,225.43489999999986,341.97000000000025,237.8368999999999,9,false],["implimented by anone who can pray.",146.40000000000001,238.43089999999984,287.87099999999998,250.83289999999988,9,false],["athletics with you whether varsity, intramural or pick-",370.20299999999997,225.42489999999987,575.7360000000001,237.82689999999991,9,false],["up games?",370.20299999999997,238.42089999999985,409.73099999999999,250.82289999999989,9,false],["G - Are there people you know who live near you",370.20299999999997,251.08389999999986,552.48000000000002,264.4668999999999,9,false],["geographically? This could be people in your",370.20299999999997,264.41289999999981,538.23300000000006,276.81489999999985,9,false],["residence hall, Greek house, off-campus apartment or",370.20299999999997,277.4088999999999,573.11700000000019,289.81089999999989,9,false],["neighborhood.",370.20299999999997,290.40489999999988,425.44499999999999,302.80689999999987,9,false],["E - Do you have a part-time job while you’re in school?",370.20299999999997,303.0678999999999,574.6110000000001,316.45089999999988,9,false],["Are there people you know who are employed with",370.20299999999997,316.39689999999985,561.1110000000001,328.79889999999983,9,false],["you?",370.20299999999997,329.39289999999983,387.96899999999999,341.79489999999981,9,false],["S - Are there people you know with whom you",370.20299999999997,342.05589999999984,543.54300000000001,355.43889999999982,9,false],["regularly socialize? These people could be members",370.20299999999997,355.38489999999979,566.38499999999999,367.78689999999978,9,false],["of your fraternity or sorority. Or they could just be",370.20299999999997,368.38089999999977,558.74400000000003,380.78289999999976,9,false],["people that you hang out with socially from time to",370.20299999999997,381.37689999999975,562.04700000000003,393.77889999999974,9,false],["time.",370.20299999999997,394.37289999999973,389.81399999999996,406.77489999999972,9,false],["PRAYER",146.40000000000001,387.81989999999996,180.52000000000001,408.35989999999998,20,false],["1. Make a List",146.40000000000001,407.1019,203.262,420.48489999999998,9,false],["Begin by making a list of 5-10 names of non-Christians",146.40000000000001,420.43089999999995,348.64800000000002,432.83289999999994,9,false],["that you know or would like to get to know and write",146.40000000000001,433.42689999999993,339.04500000000007,445.82889999999992,9,false],["them on an index card or sheet of paper. These people",146.40000000000001,446.42289999999991,343.88699999999994,458.8248999999999,9,false],["could be friends, classmates, or acquaintances who",146.40000000000001,459.41889999999989,334.995,471.82089999999988,9,false],["don’t know Christ.",146.40000000000001,472.41489999999988,215.17800000000003,484.81689999999986,9,false],["Next, make a list of people you used to know. People",370.20299999999997,420.37389999999971,565.13400000000001,432.77589999999969,9,false],["in this category could include old High School friends",370.20299999999997,433.36989999999969,572.67600000000016,445.77189999999968,9,false],["who attend your college or university or just people",370.20299999999997,446.36589999999967,563.96400000000006,458.76789999999966,9,false],["with whom you formerly hung out. Ask the Lord",370.20299999999997,459.36189999999965,551.64300000000003,471.76389999999964,9,false],["how you can renew relationships with non-believing",370.20299999999997,472.35789999999963,569.02200000000005,484.75989999999962,9,false],["friends who you have grown apart from over time.",370.20299999999997,485.35389999999961,558.32999999999993,497.7558999999996,9,false],["P R AY E R , C A R E, A N D S H A R E 1",43.841199999999994,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,625.10680000000002,9,false],["2. Who do I list?",146.40000000000001,498.08289999999988,213.20699999999999,511.46589999999986,9,false],["That’s a good question, I’m glad you asked! If building",146.40000000000001,511.41189999999983,342.94200000000001,523.81389999999988,9,false],["authentic relationships is key in reaching others",146.40000000000001,524.40789999999981,324.93300000000011,536.80989999999974,9,false],["for Christ, then where should we look to initiate",146.40000000000001,537.40389999999979,323.11500000000001,549.80589999999984,9,false],["relationships? Try thinking of people in three different",146.40000000000001,550.39989999999989,348.33300000000008,562.80189999999982,9,false],["categories:",146.40000000000001,563.39589999999976,186.69299999999998,575.7978999999998,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,576.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,588.83690000000001,9,false],["People you know",164.40000000000001,576.43489999999997,228.38100000000003,588.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,589.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,601.83690000000001,9,false],["People you used to know",164.40000000000001,589.43489999999997,257.24400000000003,601.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,602.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,614.83690000000001,9,false],["People you would like to know",164.40000000000001,602.43489999999997,278.68200000000002,614.83690000000001,9,false],["There is a third group of people and we’ll call them,",370.20299999999997,511.35489999999959,562.69500000000005,523.75689999999963,9,false],["people you would like to know. Ask yourself, is there",370.20299999999997,524.35089999999957,566.62800000000004,536.7528999999995,9,false],["anyone on campus you would like to know? Is there a",370.20299999999997,537.34689999999955,569.93100000000004,549.74889999999959,9,false],["really smart person in your Chemistry class who also",370.20299999999997,550.34289999999964,570.37200000000007,562.74489999999957,9,false],["might be able to help get your grades above C-level?",370.20299999999997,563.33889999999951,564.55799999999999,575.74089999999956,9,false],["Get to know them, win them to Christ and bring home",370.20299999999997,576.33489999999961,573.70200000000011,588.73689999999965,9,false],["a better grade in a tough class. Not a bad deal for either",370.20299999999997,589.33089999999959,575.92500000000007,601.73289999999963,9,false],["one of you! Maybe there’s a popular person on campus",370.20299999999997,602.32689999999957,574.19700000000012,614.72889999999961,9,false],["or an athlete that you would like to know. Well, get to",370.20299999999997,615.32289999999966,568.97699999999986,627.72489999999959,9,false],["know them and share the gospel.",370.20299999999997,628.31889999999964,493.44000000000005,640.72089999999957,9,false],["First, make a list of people you know who attend classes",146.40000000000001,628.43589999999995,351.95099999999996,640.83789999999999,9,false],["at your college or university. Think about people you",146.40000000000001,641.43190000000004,339.67499999999995,653.83389999999997,9,false],["know using the acronym PAGES.",146.40000000000001,654.42790000000002,268.88100000000009,666.82989999999995,9,false],["P - Are there people you know that share your similar",146.40000000000001,680.09590000000003,348.00900000000001,693.47889999999995,9,false],["political views?",146.40000000000001,693.42489999999998,205.53899999999999,705.82690000000002,9,false],["A - Are there people you know who are involved in",146.40000000000001,706.08789999999999,335.99400000000009,719.47090000000003,9,false],["3. Pray for them for two weeks",370.20299999999997,653.98689999999965,497.79599999999999,667.36989999999969,9,false],["For two weeks, pray every day for the people you listed",370.20299999999997,667.3158999999996,575.5200000000001,679.71789999999964,9,false],["on your card:",370.20299999999997,680.31189999999958,419.54999999999995,692.71389999999963,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,693.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,705.83690000000001,9,false],["Pray for them during your devotional time with",388.20000000000005,693.43489999999997,567.07500000000005,705.83690000000001,9,false],["the Lord",388.20000000000005,706.43089999999995,420.69900000000007,718.8329,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",192.9309998,764.7502197,419.06899980000003,778.53021969999998,10,false]],"h":792,"w":612},{"segs":[["•",146.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,150.54000000000002,45.836899999999901,9,false],["Partner with a friend and pray for each other’s",164.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,338.79300000000006,45.836899999999901,9,false],["lists",164.40000000000001,46.430899999999838,180.60000000000002,58.832899999999881,9,false],["you and other students in your group confidence in",370.20299999999997,33.404899999999884,562.34400000000005,45.806899999999928,9,false],["sharing the message with their friends.",370.20299999999997,46.400899999999865,517.64100000000008,58.802899999999909,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,59.434899999999857,150.54000000000002,71.836899999999901,9,false],["Pray for your lists during small group time",164.40000000000001,59.434899999999857,324.50099999999998,71.836899999999901,9,false],["Encourage others in your small group to do the same.",146.40000000000001,85.435899999999833,346.56900000000007,97.837899999999877,9,false],["This develops encouragement and accountability, and",146.40000000000001,98.431899999999814,350.35800000000006,110.83389999999986,9,false],["allows more students to be involved in praying for the",146.40000000000001,111.42789999999979,348.61200000000019,123.82989999999984,9,false],["friends.",146.40000000000001,124.42389999999978,175.65899999999999,136.82589999999982,9,false],["Pray that God: will give you opportunities to share the",146.40000000000001,137.41989999999976,349.73700000000008,149.8218999999998,9,false],["gospel; that hearts will be receptive; and the gospel",146.40000000000001,150.41589999999974,337.92000000000007,162.81789999999978,9,false],["will penetrate hard hearts.",146.40000000000001,163.41189999999972,246.58800000000002,175.81389999999976,9,false],["CARE",146.40000000000001,195.81989999999996,169.38,216.35989999999993,20,false],["Over the next two weeks, look for opportunities to",146.40000000000001,215.43489999999986,335.13900000000012,227.8368999999999,9,false],["care for the needs of the people on your list. Simply",146.40000000000001,228.43089999999984,339.08100000000013,240.83289999999988,9,false],["asking questions and listening goes a long way. Maybe",146.40000000000001,241.42689999999982,350.00700000000006,253.82889999999986,9,false],["you could invite your non-Christian friend to do",146.40000000000001,254.4228999999998,328.20900000000006,266.82489999999984,9,false],["something with you. The event is not important, but",146.40000000000001,267.41889999999978,342.93300000000011,279.82089999999982,9,false],["the fact that you are investing your life in someone",146.40000000000001,280.41489999999988,337.22700000000009,292.81689999999986,9,false],["else is what matters.",146.40000000000001,293.41089999999986,223.64699999999999,305.81289999999984,9,false],["Some Ideas",146.40000000000001,319.07889999999986,194.71199999999999,332.46189999999984,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,332.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,344.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,345.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,357.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,358.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,370.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,371.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,383.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,384.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,396.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,397.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,409.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,410.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,422.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,436.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,448.83689999999996,9,false],["Have lunch with them",164.40000000000001,332.43489999999997,248.46000000000001,344.83689999999996,9,false],["Go shopping together",164.40000000000001,345.43489999999997,246.14700000000002,357.83689999999996,9,false],["Watch a ball game or go to a game on your campus",164.40000000000001,358.43489999999997,352.18500000000006,370.83689999999996,9,false],["Get coffee or dinner out",164.40000000000001,371.43489999999997,254.18400000000003,383.83689999999996,9,false],["Eat together in the cafeteria",164.40000000000001,384.43489999999997,270.59100000000001,396.83689999999996,9,false],["Play video games",164.40000000000001,397.43489999999997,229.416,409.83689999999996,9,false],["Watch a movie together in your room or",164.40000000000001,410.43489999999997,314.75400000000008,422.83689999999996,9,false],["apartment",164.40000000000001,423.43089999999995,204.792,435.83289999999994,9,false],["If appropriate, invite them to your small group",164.40000000000001,436.43489999999997,339.78300000000002,448.83689999999996,9,false],["The goal is to deepen your relationship with your",146.40000000000001,462.43589999999995,331.66500000000008,474.83789999999993,9,false],["friend so that there is mutual trust and respect. It",146.40000000000001,475.43189999999993,332.86200000000008,487.83389999999991,9,false],["will allow you to communicate your love for them",146.40000000000001,488.42789999999991,333.24900000000014,500.8298999999999,9,false],["as a person before you share the gospel. Continue to",146.40000000000001,501.42389999999989,341.54700000000014,513.82589999999982,9,false],["develop depth with your friends throughout the six",146.40000000000001,514.41989999999987,338.71200000000005,526.82189999999991,9,false],["weeks.",146.40000000000001,527.41589999999985,172.02300000000002,539.8178999999999,9,false],["P R AY E R ,",43.841199999999994,595.24569999999994,57.071200000000005,625.89869999999996,7,false],["C A R E,",43.841200000000001,570.12969999999996,57.071200000000005,592.27070000000003,7,false],["A N D",43.841200000000001,550.69069999999999,57.071200000000005,567.15470000000005,7,false],["S H A R E 2",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,547.71569999999997,9,false],["SHARE",146.40000000000001,559.81989999999996,175.62,580.35989999999993,20,false],["The final two week period is designed to give you",146.40000000000001,579.43489999999997,330.46800000000007,591.83690000000001,9,false],["opportunities to share the gospel with your friends.",146.40000000000001,592.43090000000007,340.22400000000005,604.8329,9,false],["Hopefully, a deeper relationship has been built,",146.40000000000001,605.42689999999993,324.53700000000003,617.82889999999998,9,false],["making discussion of spiritual issues less threatening",146.40000000000001,618.42290000000003,348.94500000000005,630.82490000000007,9,false],["to both parties. Think through how you want to share",146.40000000000001,631.41890000000001,347.51400000000007,643.82090000000005,9,false],["the gospel with your friend and what tools you want to",146.40000000000001,644.41489999999999,351.51000000000005,656.81690000000003,9,false],["use (personal testimony, gospel tract, or other).",146.40000000000001,657.41090000000008,325.35599999999999,669.81290000000001,9,false],["Have an evangelism training event at the beginning",146.40000000000001,683.41189999999995,340.13400000000013,695.81389999999999,9,false],["of the last two weeks to teach students in your",146.40000000000001,696.40789999999993,320.3610000000001,708.80989999999997,9,false],["movement how to share the gospel. This will give",146.40000000000001,709.40390000000002,331.63800000000003,721.80589999999995,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",192.9309998,764.7502197,419.06899980000003,778.53021969999998,10,false]],"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792}]}